mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>From the problem statement, we have the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Since the probability of an infected person testing positive is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"294\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-